 "answer_text": "Found 4 disease records for brca1: Familial cancer of breast [7], Familial breast-ovarian cancer susceptibility 1 [8], Pancreatic cancer susceptibility 4 [9] and Fanconi anemia complementation group S [10]. \n\nMutations in this gene are responsible for approximately 40% of inherited breast cancers and more than 80% of inherited breast and ovarian cancers [1]. \n\nClinVar records for BRCA1 include NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.5243_5277+2788del [2], NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.5277+2916_5277+2946delinsGG [3], NG_005905.2:g.(147057_150288)_(160933_166866)del [4], GRCh37/hg19 17q21.31(chr17:41267743-41267796)x3 [5], and NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.2145C>G (p.Thr715=) [6]. \n\nDisease records found\n\nDisease name: Familial cancer of breast [7]. Disease name: Familial breast-ovarian cancer susceptibility 1 [8]. Disease name: Pancreatic cancer susceptibility 4 [9]. Disease name: Fanconi anemia complementation group S [10]. \n\nGene records found\n\nGene symbol: BRCA1 [11]. Gene name: BRCA1 [14]. \n\nPubmed records found\n\nPubmed title: BRCA1-BARD1 promotes RAD51-mediated homologous DNA pairing [12]. Pubmed title: BRCA1: An Endocrine and Metabolic Regulator [16]. Pubmed title: Preneoplastic stromal cells promote BRCA1-mediated breast tumorigenesis [18]. Pubmed title: Mechanism of BRCA1-BARD1 function in DNA end resection and DNA protection [20]. Pubmed title: Targeting GPX4-mediated ferroptosis protection sensitizes BRCA1-deficient cancer cells to PARP inhibitors [22]. \n\nClinvar records found\n\nClinvar title: NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.5243_5277+2788del [2]. Clinvar title: NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.5277+2916_5277+2946delinsGG [3]. Clinvar title: NG_005905.2:g.(147057_150288)_(160933_166866)del [4]. Clinvar title: GRCh37/hg19 17q21.31(chr17:41267743-41267796)x3 [5]. Clinvar title: NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.2145C>G (p.Thr715=) [6]. \n\nOmim records found\n\nBRCA1 DNA REPAIR-ASSOCIATED PROTEIN [13]. BRCA1 [13]. \n\nClinical trial records found\n\nClinical trial name: Germline BRCA1 and BRCA2